### Part 3: Update `StepProgress` (Secondary Coupling)

While examining the codebase, I noticed `/private/var/folders/_q/qzh8_t6s15388qqf3p6n3d200000gp/T/bench-aosah494/src/ui/progress.rs` also creates `BivvyTheme::new()` internally (line 33). This is acceptable since `StepProgress` lives within the `ui` module -- it is not a cross-module leak. No changes needed here for this task.

